<title>USA: About 1.22 mln Jefferson shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>About 1.22 mln Jefferson shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferson Bankshares Inc said Friday that about 1.22 million shares of its common stock were tendered in its modified Dutch auction tender offer as of Thursday.</p>
</text>
